+stratum, grey fill the single-ring collapses, corner badges the
+accidental-symmetry classes. \textbf{Degeneracy island.} A detached
+$1 \times 4$ inset records the four named degenerate strata (equal-
+modulus, discriminant / resonant multiplicity, zero-root, enhanced
+symmetry) with codimension-$1$ connector arrows to the parent atlas
+cells. The TikZ source is included in the Zenodo
+dataset~\cite{wkb_dataset_v1} as \texttt{code/render\_taxonomy.tex};
+the rendered standalone figure file is \texttt{figures/taxonomy\_tikz.tex}.}
+\label{fig:taxonomy}
+\end{figure}
